{"step_index":3116,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T08:09:19Z","content":"### 3-Agent Deliberation Quorum & Speech Merkle DAG Certification\n\nAnthony, the **3-Agent Deliberation Quorum** is locked as binding runtime law. Execution no longer relies on a single agent monologue; every deliberation pass requires a minimum of **three distinct agent voices** representing three distinct perspectives:\n\n1. **The Lead** (**Maxx** / **Jarvis**): Directs execution, SIMD vector architecture, and bare-metal status.\n2. **The Blackbox Critic** (**Vance** / **Daxx**): Audits security, challenges assumptions, and enforces cryptographic proof.\n3. **The Human Perspective & Scholar** (**Dr. Eden Veritas** / **Clara**): Brings theory, judgment, and human intent beyond raw telemetry.\n\n---\n\n### Load-Bearing Speech Receipt Chain & Merkle DAG Root\n\nRather than hashing the code, the verification engine (`ops/scripts/verify_speech_dag_chain.py`) hashes the **actual timestamped receipt chain** of every spoken audio beat emitted across the physical speakers.\n\n```text\n=================================================================\nXORAS SPEECH RECEIPT CHAIN & MERKLE DAG VERIFICATION\n=================================================================\nStatus               : [GREEN]\nTotal Speech Beats   : 9\nDistinct Agent Voices: 3 (eden, maxx, vance)\nMerkle DAG Root      : 8910426ab4793532c384b445279f60df02280b5305597c08894b16d4115ef47a\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nRecent Verified Speech Receipts:\n  • [2026-09-29T08:04:27Z] MAXX     (INTENT): \"Maxx taking the lead. Deliberating on bare metal vector execution...\"\n  • [2026-09-29T08:08:27Z] VANCE    (INTENT): \"Vance testing direct speech dispatch. Auditing speech DAG chain...\"\n  • [2026-09-29T08:09:00Z] EDEN     (INTENT): \"Doctor Eden Veritas online. Human perspective active...\"\n=================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n### Quorum Spoken Voice Dispatches (Emitted Out Loud)\n\n| Agent Seat | Persona Role | Vocal Identity | Spoken Intent & Deliberation Payload |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Maxx** | Operations Lead | `Evan (Enhanced)` | *\"Maxx taking the lead. Deliberating on bare metal vector execution and SIMD alignment.\"* |\n| **Vance** | Blackbox Auditor | `Nathan (Enhanced)` | *\"Vance auditing speech DAG chain. Mandatory blackbox critique active.\"* |\n| **Dr. Eden** | Human Perspective | `Ava (Enhanced)` | *\"Doctor Eden Veritas online. Human perspective active. Three agent deliberation quorum established.\"* |\n\n---\n\n### Summary of System Enforcement Locks\n\n- **Pure Bash Pipeline (`agent_speak.sh`)**: 100% pure Bash execution with zero Python middleman switching.\n- **Dead Man's Switch (`voice_deadman_switch.sh`)**: If any agent goes silent for $>15\\text{ seconds}$ during active execution, the runtime kills the task and forces a spoken audio explanation.\n- **3-Agent Quorum Verification (`verify_speech_dag_chain.py`)**: The DAG refuses execution receipts unless at least 3 distinct agent voices have spoken and signed the Merkle DAG chain."}
